5v regulator</text>
<text x="43.434" y="60.579" size="1.016" layer="26" font="fixed" distance="40" rot="MR0">The Arduino Vin is connected to LocoNet RailSync
and Power Input. Use this to power the interface
from LocoNet or the Power Input Connector</text>
